     <target value="0.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">See breakdown below</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="0.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">A similar situation exists with respect to the Mines &amp; Minerals Act.  Specifically, (i) The Mines &amp; Minerals Draft Act wasrewritten based on intl experience and consultations were held.  However, this draft will not be submitted to Parliament due to theelectioncycle (and concerns about repealing/replacing an Act in an election year). (ii) Cadastre is operating but not effective.There arewidespread concerns with independence, efficacy &amp; financial viablity of cadastre and related governance issues.Theconcerns aboutthecadastre were discussed with GRZ and while some technical progress was made (e.g. hiring of a firm to update &amp;improve the software)the other issues are of a political nature and given the election season, are unlikely to be addressed.NOTE:New M&amp;E Officer for project is updating indicators values and this information will be entered upon receipt.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
