      <narrative xml:lang="EN"></narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2004-06-25"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2011-11-30"></period-end>
     <target value="60.00"></target>
     <actual value="90.00">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Progress has been made by GRZ including:1) Formal drafting of new Tourism &amp; Hospitality Act that was based on internationalbestpractice and consultations with industry.  2) Construction of the One Stop Shop in Livingstone is ahead of schedule3) the OneStop Shop is now a joint initiative of MTENR and MCTI and will house a range of licensing authorities.While this represents solidprogress, the indicator can only be achieved after the THA is enacted.  The Presidential election has delayed enactment, andtheMinistry of Justice advises that the proposed Act will go to Parliament in the first sitting of the new Government.  However,this could betoo late for the SEED Project - which closes in November 2011.NOTE: New M&amp;E Officer for project is updatingindicators values andthis information will be entered upon receipt. The above value is an estimate.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
